First find the speed:
\[
v=\frac{750}{0.50}=1500\,\mathrm{m\,s^{-1}}
\]
From \(v=\sqrt{B/\rho}\),
\[
\rho=\frac{B}{v^2}=\frac{2.0\times10^9}{(1500)^2}
=8.9\times10^2\,\mathrm{kg\,m^{-3}}
\]
One assumption is that the medium is uniform, so a single bulk modulus and density describe the path.
